  "description": "The Axial WS C:62 SL Team's combination of the best frame materials and the finest components makes it the perfect choice for the discerning racer in you, whether you're battling for position in the peloton or duking it out with your training buddies on a Tuesday night. You don't need to compromise because we didn't, either. Our Advanced Twin Mold monocoque technology gives us full control over fibre lay-up during construction, so we can fine tune every area of the frame to optimise weight and stiffness. The icing on the cake is our premium C:62 carbon, which has the strength to enable us to build such a lightweight yet exceptionally strong chassis. Controlled flex in the seat stays, a flattened top tube and carbon fork blades all add comfort without compromising efficiency. Read more... And we didn't stop there. Shimano's peerless 2x11 Ultegra transmission serves up flawless gear shifts every time, while matching hydraulic disc brakes offer perfect modulation and control in any weather conditions. Throw in the light, stiff and strong Newmen wheelset and grippy, fast-rolling Continental tyres, and you've got all the ingredients for a supremely fast, agile and light race machine.",
